WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Welcome to Blockchain and Money, MIT Course 15.S12.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
This is Lecture 1: Introduction to Blockchain Technology.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
I'm Professor Gary Gensler, and today we'll explore

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
the fundamental principles of blockchain and cryptocurrencies.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
We'll discuss cryptography, consensus mechanisms,

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
and the revolutionary impact on money and financial systems.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
This course will provide a comprehensive understanding

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
of how blockchain technology is reshaping our world.
